---
source: crates/dreamd-cli/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: "nested_subcommand_help(\"memory\", \"checkout\")"
---
Replace the live memory files with branch <NAME> and make it current.

Refuses while the daemon socket exists; stop `dreamd watch` first. Prints the object id.

Usage: checkout <NAME>

Arguments:
  <NAME>
          Branch name to check out

Options:
  -h, --help
          Print help (see a summary with '-h')
